{
  "name": "dsh-porthole",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "description": "DSH 局域网访问桥（Lite）：反向代理 + 局域网二维码 + 双密码访问认证 + 会话投影剥离 + 远程工作区管理。",
  "releaseNotes": "【v1.2.0】① 迁移会话投影剥离：session/list 响应移除 contextHeaders/contextTimeline（支持 gzip），实机 9/9 会话验证，手机端首次加载列表的流量降一个量级；② 迁移远程工作区管理（仅面板，无手机端）：目录浏览 + 一键注册进 DSH workspaceRegistry 并挂接会话，敏感目录/系统目录/符号链接逃逸全量过滤，未设密码时强制先设密码；③ 修复上游同款 bug：原版 service.ctx 从未赋值导致工作区从不真正注册，Lite 显式接线并实机验证；④ §4.1 polyfill 实测关闭：DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 前端不含 randomUUID 调用。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./locale/*": "./locale/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "GAP-REPORT.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build:client": "node client/build.mjs",
    "prepack": "npm run build:client",
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "qrcode": "^1.5.3"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2",
    "react": "^18.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^18.3.1"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
